Git hooks for podcast-mgr
=========================

post-checkout
    Fires on initial clone.  Compiles nob.c then runs ./nob to produce
    index.cgi.  Requires a C compiler on PATH.

Activation
----------
After cloning, run once:

    git config core.hooksPath .githooks

To activate globally for all repos:

    git config --global core.hooksPath $(pwd)/.githooks
